WEBVTT

00:03.223 --> 00:10.257
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:11.774 --> 00:15.326
- Hmm,
I love you.
- 嗯，
我爱你。

00:15.360 --> 00:17.671
And I love you.
我爱你。

00:17.705 --> 00:20.774
And I love you.
我爱你。

00:20.809 --> 00:22.912
Heh-heh-heh.
呵呵。

00:22.947 --> 00:25.774
And I love you too.
我也爱你。

00:25.809 --> 00:27.464
Oooh.
哦。

00:27.498 --> 00:29.567
[laughs]
[笑]

00:29.602 --> 00:31.050
I tell ya,
Mr. Squidward,
我告诉你，
章鱼哥先生，

00:31.085 --> 00:34.981
today's been our best day of
business in years.
今天是我们最美好的一天
几年的生意。

00:35.016 --> 00:36.912
Yep, profits are so good,
是啊，利润真好

00:36.947 --> 00:39.567
there's nothing that could
possibly ruin
没有什么可以
可能毁掉

00:39.602 --> 00:42.188
this perfect...
what?
这个完美的...
什么？

00:42.223 --> 00:44.498
No!
不！

00:44.533 --> 00:45.981
- Augh!
- 啊啊！

00:46.016 --> 00:48.947
Ow!
- Mr. Krabs. Are you okay?
噢！
- 蟹老板。你还好吗？

00:48.981 --> 00:50.740
- Oh!
- Oooh!
- 哦！
- 哦！

00:50.774 --> 00:52.498
What's a matter?
Is there too much money?
有什么事吗？
钱太多了吗？

00:52.533 --> 00:54.292
I'll get rid of the money.
我会把钱处理掉的。

00:54.326 --> 00:57.878
- What are you...
masticatin' me moolah.
- 你是什么...
咀嚼我的钱。

00:57.912 --> 01:00.636
I ain't upset about the money,
boy.
我不为钱而烦恼
男孩。

01:00.671 --> 01:03.119
I'm upset about him.
我对他感到不安。

01:04.602 --> 01:05.843
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:05.878 --> 01:07.533
- Old Man Jenkins?
- 老詹金斯？

01:07.567 --> 01:09.360
But I love Old Man Jenkins.
但我喜欢老詹金斯。

01:09.395 --> 01:13.809
He always has old and
interesting smells,
他总是有老和
有趣的气味，

01:13.843 --> 01:17.395
and his bones make such funny
noises,
他的骨头很有趣
噪音，

01:17.429 --> 01:20.671
and his eyes are the milkiest
shade of white, and...
他的眼睛是最乳白色的
白色阴影，以及...

01:24.671 --> 01:26.809
- Ahh-ooh! Eeeee!
- 啊哦！哎呀！

01:26.843 --> 01:29.809
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:29.843 --> 01:32.705
- Every day, it's the
same routine...
- 每一天都是这样
同样的套路...

01:32.740 --> 01:35.774
- I'll have...
- 我会有...

01:35.809 --> 01:39.947
a small coffee.
一杯小咖啡。

01:39.981 --> 01:43.464
- Hmm, that'll be 25 cents.
- 嗯，那就是 25 美分。

01:43.498 --> 01:47.119
- I don't think so, Charlie.
- 我不这么认为，查理。

01:47.154 --> 01:50.947
I get the senior discount.
我得到高级折扣。

01:50.981 --> 01:53.947
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

01:53.981 --> 01:57.602
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

01:58.567 --> 02:00.981
Then he hogs that table all
day...
然后他霸占了那张桌子
日...

02:01.016 --> 02:02.050
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

02:02.085 --> 02:03.602
- And annoys all me other
customers.
- 还惹恼了我其他人
客户。

02:03.636 --> 02:05.602
- [gulping]
- [吞咽]

02:05.636 --> 02:09.050
Ahh!
啊！

02:09.085 --> 02:11.912
- And he don't buy nothin'
else neither.
- 他什么也不买
否则也没有。

02:11.947 --> 02:15.843
He just makes that disgustin'
condiment soup
他只是让那件事变得令人厌恶
调味汤

02:15.878 --> 02:20.154
and listens to his radio,
all for free.
并听他的广播，
全部免费。

02:20.188 --> 02:22.429
And anytime someone
says somethin' to him,
并且任何时候有人
对他说了一些话

02:22.464 --> 02:24.705
it's always the same
response...
总是一样的
回应...

02:24.740 --> 02:28.912
- Excuse me, could you turn the
volume down on your soup?
- 打扰一下，你能转动一下吗？
减少汤的量？

02:28.947 --> 02:33.326
- Respect your elders.
- 尊重长辈。

02:33.360 --> 02:34.843
- Ugh!
- 呃！

02:34.878 --> 02:36.671
Yes, sir. Sorry, sir.
是的，先生。对不起，先生。

02:36.705 --> 02:39.429
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

02:39.464 --> 02:43.257
- Ooh, it just makes me so
steaming mad.
- 哦，这让我如此
热气腾腾的疯了。

02:43.292 --> 02:46.119
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:48.464 --> 02:49.740
- Ooh.
[sniffs]
- 哦。
[嗅嗅]

02:49.774 --> 02:50.809
Ahh.
啊。

02:50.843 --> 02:53.843
- Well, I won't stand
for it no more.
- 好吧，我不会忍受
不再有这样的事了。

02:53.878 --> 02:55.912
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

02:55.947 --> 02:58.567
- It's time to kick out the
coot.
- 是时候踢掉
傻瓜。

02:58.602 --> 03:00.981
- Eh? What's going on now?
- 呃？现在发生什么事了？

03:01.016 --> 03:03.464
- Hey. If that's how you treat
the elderly,
- 嘿。如果你就是这样对待的
老年人，

03:03.498 --> 03:07.429
then I'm never eating another
Krabby Patty in here again.
那我就再也不吃别的了
克拉比帕蒂又来了。

03:07.464 --> 03:08.395
- Me neither.
- 我也不。

03:08.429 --> 03:09.947
- Give the poor old guy a
break.
- 给这个可怜的老家伙一个
打破。

03:09.981 --> 03:12.602
- Oh. Uh, it's okay.
- 哦。呃，没关系。

03:12.636 --> 03:17.498
I--I was just...shaking
the dust off him. See?
我——我只是……发抖
他身上的灰尘。看？

03:17.533 --> 03:18.947
- Whaa-ahh!
- 哇啊啊！

03:18.981 --> 03:22.050
Ahh! Uh, wait.
啊！呃，等等。

03:22.085 --> 03:25.602
Let's see here.
让我们看看这里。

03:25.636 --> 03:27.912
Heh, there. Heh-heh-heh.
呵呵，那里。呵呵。

03:27.947 --> 03:31.947
- Respect your elders.
- 尊重长辈。

03:31.981 --> 03:34.809
[banjo twanging]
[班卓琴弦音]

03:34.843 --> 03:36.567
- ♪ Oohhhhhhh
- ♪ 哦哦哦哦

03:36.602 --> 03:39.567
♪ Elders are your betters
cause we're older ♪
♪ 长辈比你强
因为我们都老了♪

03:39.602 --> 03:43.360
♪ So all you whippersnappers
get in line ♪
♪ 所以你们这些自命不凡的人
排队吧♪

03:43.395 --> 03:46.567
♪ Y'all best be respectful
of your elders ♪
♪ 你们最好保持尊重
你的长辈的♪

03:46.602 --> 03:49.464
♪ Or we'll whip you
with a soup spoon every time ♪
♪ 不然我们就鞭打你
每次都用汤勺♪

03:49.498 --> 03:50.498
Ha!
哈!

03:50.533 --> 03:55.464
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:55.498 --> 03:58.016
Ahh!
啊！

03:58.050 --> 03:59.360
- Well, gee, Mr. Krabs.
- 好吧，蟹老板先生。

03:59.395 --> 04:01.292
If you want Old Man Jenkins to
leave,
如果你想让老詹金斯
离开，

04:01.326 --> 04:04.671
why not just try
asking him nicely?
为什么不尝试一下
好意地问他吗？

04:04.705 --> 04:10.085
- I think you oughta be the one
to ask him nicely.
- 我想你应该是那个人
好好地问他。

04:13.774 --> 04:15.360
"Oh, hi. I'm SpongeBob,
“哦，嗨。我是海绵宝宝，

04:15.395 --> 04:18.671
"and I love you, but will
you go home, please?
“我爱你，但会
请你回家吧？

04:18.705 --> 04:21.050
Hee-hee-hee-hee."
嘿嘿嘿嘿。”

04:21.085 --> 04:22.567
"I'm Old Man Jenkins,
“我是老詹金斯，

04:22.602 --> 04:27.705
and I'm a jerk who likes to
cost Mr. Krabs money."
我是个喜欢这样做的混蛋
花了蟹老板的钱。”

04:27.740 --> 04:28.740
- Ohh.
- 哦。

04:28.774 --> 04:30.119
- What the?
- 什么？

04:30.154 --> 04:31.740
- [whispering]
- [低语]

04:31.774 --> 04:33.292
Ahh!
啊！

04:33.326 --> 04:35.602
- What is going on,
boy-o?
- 发生了什么事，
男孩-o？

04:35.636 --> 04:38.636
Why ain't Jenkins vacatin' me
restaurant?
詹金斯为什么不让我休息
餐厅？

04:38.671 --> 04:40.292
- Oh, Mr. Krabs.
- 噢，蟹老板。

04:40.326 --> 04:42.050
I couldn't ask Old Man Jenkins
to leave
我不能问老詹金斯
离开

04:42.085 --> 04:43.429
after hearing his story.
听完他的故事后。

04:43.464 --> 04:46.257
His feet hurt,
and his grandson never calls,
他的脚很痛，
他的孙子从不打电话，

04:46.292 --> 04:48.292
and he has to take a pill that
helps him to remember
他必须服药
帮助他记住

04:48.326 --> 04:49.740
to take his other pills.
服用他的其他药物。

04:49.774 --> 04:51.292
Why, he takes so many pills,
为什么，他吃了这么多药，

04:51.326 --> 04:53.809
he's more pill than man.
他更像是一颗药丸，而不是一个人。

04:53.843 --> 04:59.016
- Okay, time to step it up...
to passive aggression.
- 好吧，是时候加强了...
到被动攻击。

04:59.050 --> 05:01.016
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

05:01.050 --> 05:04.292
This'll make him uncomfortable.
这会让他不舒服。

05:06.292 --> 05:09.154
[together]
Ooh. Whew. Ooh.
[一起]
哦。呼。哦。

05:09.188 --> 05:12.567
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

05:12.602 --> 05:14.498
[groaning]
[呻吟]

05:14.533 --> 05:16.085
Ahhh.
啊哈。

05:16.119 --> 05:18.636
- Ahhh....
- 啊啊....

05:18.671 --> 05:21.809
[groaning]
[呻吟]

05:21.843 --> 05:25.981
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

05:26.016 --> 05:27.223
- Ehh...ehh...
- 呃…呃…

05:27.257 --> 05:30.395
it's too cold in here
for my old blood.
这里太冷了
为了我古老的血液。

05:33.395 --> 05:37.705
Show a little respect for your
elders and turn up the heat.
对你表示一点尊重
长辈们，把暖气调大。

05:37.740 --> 05:41.154
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

05:41.188 --> 05:44.395
- Thank you.
- 谢谢。

05:46.567 --> 05:49.533
- So you can take the heat,
- 这样你就可以承受热量，

05:49.567 --> 05:53.602
but can you take...the beat?
但你能把握……节拍吗？

05:53.636 --> 05:57.119
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

05:57.154 --> 05:59.326
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

05:59.360 --> 06:02.119
- Ahh! Ahh! Ahh! Ahh! Ahh!
- 啊！啊！啊！啊！啊！

06:02.154 --> 06:06.912
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

06:06.947 --> 06:14.257
♪
♪
♪
♪

06:15.740 --> 06:18.223
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

06:18.257 --> 06:21.085
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

06:21.119 --> 06:22.774
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

06:22.809 --> 06:24.395
I don't understand.
我不明白。

06:24.429 --> 06:26.912
How could you endure
that cacophony?
你怎么忍得住
那个刺耳的声音？

06:26.947 --> 06:28.981
- Bleh-ahh! Ehh.
- 哎呀啊！呃。

06:29.016 --> 06:31.050
Eh? You say something?
呃？你说点什么？

06:31.085 --> 06:33.395
I'm a little deaf in my ears.
我耳朵有点聋。

06:33.429 --> 06:37.395
- Really? Then what's with
the radio?
- 真的吗？那又怎样
收音机？

06:37.429 --> 06:38.395
Huh?
啊？

06:38.429 --> 06:42.119
- I like to cook on
the vacuum tubes.
- 我喜欢做饭
真空管。

06:42.154 --> 06:45.567
Now show some respect for your
elders!
现在对你表示一些尊重
长老们！

06:45.602 --> 06:47.774
[munching]
[咀嚼]

06:47.809 --> 06:49.050
- Arrgh!
- 啊啊！

06:49.085 --> 06:51.671
Jenkins, I'm putting me foot
down.
詹金斯，我要站起来了
下来。

06:51.705 --> 06:55.188
You're ruining me business, and
you're costing me money.
你毁了我的生意
你在浪费我的钱。

06:55.223 --> 06:58.188
Whoo, whoa.
哇哦。

06:58.223 --> 06:59.567
Now get out.
现在出去吧。

06:59.602 --> 07:03.429
- It ain't legal to throw out
the elderly in this town.
- 扔掉是不合法的
这个镇上的老人。

07:03.464 --> 07:07.981
So respect your elders!
所以要尊重长辈！

07:08.016 --> 07:13.050
- Respect...my...elders, hmm?
- 尊重...我的...长辈，嗯？

07:13.085 --> 07:15.705
Oh, Old Man Jenkins,
哦，老詹金斯，

07:15.740 --> 07:18.843
I've got someone I'd like you
to meet.
我有一个想要你的人
见面。

07:18.878 --> 07:20.843
- Hm? What's this about now?
- 嗯？现在这是什么情况？

07:20.878 --> 07:23.636
- This here is me father.
- 这是我的父亲。

07:23.671 --> 07:25.912
And he is older than you.
而且他比你大。

07:25.947 --> 07:29.498
So you best respect
what he has to say.
所以你最好尊重
他必须说的话。

07:29.533 --> 07:31.154
- Ahoy there, Jenkins.
- 嘿，詹金斯。

07:31.188 --> 07:35.016
Time for you to be hoistin'
your sails and movin' on, son.
是时候让你起身了
儿子，你扬帆起航，继续前进。

07:35.050 --> 07:38.016
- Oh, I don't think so.
- 哦，我不这么认为。

07:38.050 --> 07:40.395
This is my father,
这是我的父亲，

07:40.429 --> 07:44.326
Very Old Man Jenkins, Sr.
非常老的詹金斯先生

07:44.360 --> 07:49.085
He's even older than your old
man, Krabs.
他甚至比你还老
哥们，蟹蟹。

07:49.119 --> 07:52.223
- And I say we stay.
- 我说我们留下来。

07:52.257 --> 07:56.223
Both you young uns should
respect your elders.
你们年轻人都应该
尊重你的长辈。

07:56.257 --> 08:00.636
- And I say both you Jenkinses
should respect your elder...
- 我说你们俩都是詹金斯
应该尊重长辈...

08:00.671 --> 08:03.429
me grandpappy.
我爷爷。

08:03.464 --> 08:06.878
- Two can play at that game.
- 两个人可以参加那个游戏。

08:06.912 --> 08:10.705
Meet Grandpa Jenkins. Ha-ha.
认识詹金斯爷爷。哈哈。

08:10.740 --> 08:12.360
- I remember the day when
Krabby Patties
- 我记得那天
蟹肉饼

08:12.395 --> 08:13.740
used to cost a dime.
曾经花费一毛钱。

08:13.774 --> 08:17.947
- Oh, yeah? Well, I remember
when they cost a nickel. Hm?
- 哦，是吗？嗯，我记得
当它们花费五分钱时。嗯？

08:17.981 --> 08:20.464
- Okay, let's not give anyone
ideas about cheap patties.
- 好吧，我们不给任何人
关于廉价肉饼的想法。

08:20.498 --> 08:24.809
Now, out with the old, and in
with the even older.
现在，淘汰旧的，进新的
与更年长的人。

08:26.878 --> 08:30.429
Right, Great-Grandpappy Krabs?
Ha-ha.
对吧，蟹曾爷爷？
哈哈。

08:30.464 --> 08:33.636
- Wake up, Great-Grandpop.
- 醒醒吧，曾祖父。

08:33.671 --> 08:37.188
Defend the family's honor.
捍卫家族荣誉。

08:37.223 --> 08:38.602
Hee-ya!
- Ohh!
嘿呀！
- 哦！

08:38.636 --> 08:41.705
- Ooh, respect...someone.
- 哦，尊重...某人。

08:41.740 --> 08:43.636
- Am I an elder?
- 我是长辈吗？

08:43.671 --> 08:45.429
- Ohh.
- 哦。

08:45.464 --> 08:49.740
Oh, Great-Great-Grandpa
Krabs,
噢，曾曾祖父
螃蟹,

08:49.774 --> 08:51.360
return to us.
返回到我们身边。

08:51.395 --> 08:54.154
I beseech thee.
我恳求你。

08:54.188 --> 08:56.085
Ha. You're older than they are.
哈。你比他们都老。

08:56.119 --> 08:57.981
Kick 'em out.
把他们踢出去。

08:58.016 --> 09:00.567
- I want to speak with my
- 我想和我的

09:00.602 --> 09:04.740
Great-Great-Grandpa Jenkins.
曾曾祖父詹金斯。

09:04.774 --> 09:07.533
Ahh.
啊。

09:07.567 --> 09:10.360
Get 'em,
Ancient-Great-Grand-Pop.
得到他们，
古代伟大的流行音乐。

09:10.395 --> 09:14.016
- Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm-mm.
- 毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米。

09:14.050 --> 09:17.981
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

09:18.016 --> 09:21.326
- Youthum Ignorami,
-Youthum Ignorami，
-Youthum Ignorami，
-尤瑟姆·伊格诺拉米，

09:21.360 --> 09:24.774
Elderus Respecticus.
尊敬的长老。

09:24.809 --> 09:27.774
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:27.809 --> 09:28.671
♪
♪
♪
♪

09:28.705 --> 09:32.705
- [chuckling]
Here we go.
- [轻笑]
我们开始吧。

09:38.292 --> 09:42.498
Ha-ha.
哈哈。

09:42.533 --> 09:45.085
- You best respect your elders.
- 你最好尊重你的长辈。

09:45.119 --> 09:49.016
- My elders will teach your
elders a little respect.
- 我的长辈会教你
对长辈有一点尊重。

09:49.050 --> 09:50.947
Get 'em, Krabses!
抓住他们，克拉布西斯！

09:50.981 --> 09:53.498
- Jenkinses, attack!
- 詹金斯，进攻！

09:53.533 --> 09:56.119
both: Ahh-ahh!
两人：啊啊啊！

09:56.154 --> 09:58.533
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:58.567 --> 10:02.016
- Hey. Hey, uh, you
guys are kind of
- 嘿。嘿，呃，你
伙计们都有点

10:02.050 --> 10:03.705
bumming us out.
让我们很沮丧。

10:03.740 --> 10:06.050
- Yes, we don't get
to visit the land
- 是的，我们不明白
参观这片土地

10:06.085 --> 10:08.085
of the living very often.
经常发生在生活中。

10:08.119 --> 10:10.774
- And we just want to party!
- 我们只是想参加派对！

10:10.809 --> 10:14.257
- You two party-poopers need to
respect your elders
- 你们两个不喜欢派对的人需要
尊重长辈

10:14.292 --> 10:16.050
and vacate the premises.
并腾出场地。

10:16.085 --> 10:19.671
both: Ahh!
两人：啊！

10:19.705 --> 10:23.257
[upbeat dance music]
【欢快的舞曲】

10:23.292 --> 10:25.360
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

10:25.395 --> 10:27.292
Looks like it's gonna be a
while.
看起来这将是一个
同时。

10:27.326 --> 10:32.119
- What do we do now?
- 我们现在做什么？

10:32.154 --> 10:33.533
- Come on, guys.
- 来吧，伙计们。

10:33.567 --> 10:36.740
You've been sitting here all
day.
你一直坐在这里
一天。

10:36.774 --> 10:39.774
Doesn't anyone want
to order some chum?
没有人想要吗
点一些密友？

10:39.809 --> 10:43.188
- I'll just have a small
coffee, please.
- 我只要一个小
请喝杯咖啡。

10:43.223 --> 10:45.429
- I got this one, Krabby...
- 我拿到了这个，克拉比……

10:45.464 --> 10:48.085
with my senior discount.
与我的高级折扣。

10:48.119 --> 10:50.257
Here ya go, Jimbo.
给你，金博。

10:50.292 --> 10:51.602
- Oof!
- 噢！

10:51.636 --> 10:52.981
Ow!
噢！

10:53.016 --> 10:54.326
That's it.
就是这样。

10:54.360 --> 10:57.464
Both of you out!
你们两个都出去吧！

10:57.498 --> 11:01.395
both: Respect your elders!
两人：尊敬长辈！

两人：尊敬长辈！